hem in the workshop on the ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A large part of the world to explore will be underwater, this part you will need to explore with the help of a submarine that makes the gameplay more diverse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The submarine can also be upgraded</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Move around the world with the help of an abandoned train network built by another civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "The main character of the game, Arisa, because of the breakdowns of the spaceship gets to an unusual and beautiful planet full of various monsters, which was not part of her plans. You will need to help the heroine repair the ship and get out of this planet.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, Russian, Japanese, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356360/0933f83d8fa8b0b8c053066e4d7566c03a5af58d/header.jpg?t=1788014017", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356360/6c6e193068eceae26885f461ad2353b8e9e65334/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788014017", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356360/6c6e193068eceae26885f461ad2353b8e9e65334/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788014017", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo E4500 @ 2.2GHz or AMD Athlon 64 X2 5600+ @ 2.8 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce 240 GT or Radeon HD 6570 – 1024 MB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Window